	"translations": [
		{
			"language": "zh_CN",
			"displayName": "Polyglot",
			"description": "支持多种引擎的 NVDA 翻译插件。",
			"changelog": "### 1.4.0\n\n- 全新安装时，默认目标语言与 NVDA 界面语言保持一致；升级用户保留原有语言设置。\n- 执行翻译、复制结果、清除缓存或切换自动翻译后，自动退出命令层。切换语言和引擎时仍可连续操作。\n- 更新 VIVO 翻译，适配当前接口。\n- 完善乌克兰语翻译。"
		},
		{
			"language": "vi",
			"displayName": "Polyglot",
			"description": "Một add-on dịch thuật dành cho NVDA hỗ trợ nhiều bộ dịch khác nhau.",
			"changelog": "### 1.4.0\n\n- Default the target language to NVDA’s interface language for new installations, while preserving existing users’ language settings.\n- Automatically exit the command layer after translation, copying results, clearing the cache, or toggling auto-translation. Language and engine switching remain available for consecutive commands.\n- Update VIVO Translate to use its current API.\n- Improve Ukrainian translations."
		},
		{
			"language": "uk",
			"displayName": "Поліглот",
			"description": "Додаток для перекладу з підтримкою декількох сервісів перекладу.",
			"changelog": "### 1.4.0\n\n- Default the target language to NVDA’s interface language for new installations, while preserving existing users’ language settings.\n- Automatically exit the command layer after translation, copying results, clearing the cache, or toggling auto-translation. Language and engine switching remain available for consecutive commands.\n- Update VIVO Translate to use its current API.\n- Improve Ukrainian translations."
		}
	],
